<p>Israel carried out new strikes in eastern and southern Lebanon on Sunday after Israel and Lebanon agreed in Washington to extend a ceasefire by 45 days, Lebanon’s state-run National News Agency reported. NNA said two Israeli strikes hit Sohmor in the Bekaa Valley and that other attacks targeted areas around Nabatieh and Tyre; Israel said it was striking Hezbollah infrastructure. The fighting followed Saturday strikes in southern Lebanon. Hezbollah-linked officials rejected the ceasefire process, with one lawmaker describing Lebanon’s negotiations with Israel as a “dead end,” while Hezbollah said it continued attacks on Israeli positions in southern Lebanon and northern Israel. Reports said an Israeli strike on a health or Civil Defence center in Hanouiyeh killed six people, including three paramedics or first responders. Haaretz reported that Lebanon said 19 people had been killed in Israeli strikes over the previous 24 hours, while the Israeli military said four soldiers were wounded after Hezbollah said it attacked Israeli positions.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/9rNs3AXa_Ihd3kjMpp4dfMwLwNsKNMeW6c1nMrW7bHPH0yV6bo61rngim0kBHXD8TSs1rqzeiomDC67sAQfM29k7zNORjjHkMAjMtPGvxdmvbnmpQQeTP90HmfN85Qwwbmwa-VCtZjjaIke3AYk37c--UKWtopNmIDQsQgi20b25KFvijjoZ08p4WkjkeYhEqkGrbBTekfXYRVDYkKpVmewuQWf1XJOrIXhX1VSvqQtrhpw3G5KwFwPhqQLowtseR-QdWE1DT9-4Li-kLA' alt='Smoke rises from the site of an Israeli air strike that targeted the southern Lebanese village of Al Qlailah.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Evacuation warnings: The Israeli military warned residents of nine villages in the Sidon and Nabatieh regions to evacuate before strikes, and AAJ reported that such warnings have repeatedly preceded strikes during the ceasefire.</li><li>Expanded range: Lebanon’s NNA reported strikes on more than 20 southern villages Saturday, including one more than 50 kilometers from the border.</li><li>Hezbollah attacks: Hezbollah said it used rockets, explosive drones and explosive devices against Israeli troops, vehicles and bulldozers near Bayyada, Rashaf, Hadatha and Adaisseh.</li><li>Israeli losses: Israel’s military reported another soldier killed in fighting in southern Lebanon, bringing Israeli military deaths since early March to 21, according to Taiwan’s Central News Agency.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Israeli military: The military said Hezbollah launched rockets and explosive drones overnight toward Israeli forces in southern Lebanon and reported a suspicious aerial target near Misgav Am, with no casualties in that incident. (<a href='https://www.middleeasteye.net/live-blog/live-blog-update/israel-reports-drone-and-rocket-attacks-hezbollah'>Middle East Eye</a>)</li><li>Hezbollah: The group said its attacks were a response to Israeli ceasefire violations and claimed Israeli soldiers were killed or wounded when it targeted a unit near Safita. (<a href='https://www.haber7.com/dunya/haber/3628669-israile-roket-saldirisi-oluler-ve-yaralilar-var'>Haber7</a>)</li><li>Displaced residents: Reports said thousands of southern Lebanese displaced from their homes remained skeptical about the truce as bombardment continued. (<a href='https://english.aaj.tv/news/330459084/israel-strikes-southern-lebanon-again-despite-truce-extension'>AAJ TV</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/israel-strikes-lebanon-while-hezbollah-calls-talks-dead-end/article70989999.ece'>Israel strikes Lebanon while Hezbollah calls talks ‘dead end’</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/us-iran-war-news-live-updates-tehran-prepares-professional-mechanism-for-strait-of-hormuz-traffic-strikes-lebanon-despite-ceasefire-trump-11506528#publisher=newsstand'>US Iran War News LIVE Updates: Tehran Prepares &quot;Mechanism&quot; For Hormuz Traffic, Israel Strikes Lebanon</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/5/17/new-wave-of-israeli-strikes-pound-lebanon-despit